<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells no OLOs at non-competitive auction.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells no OLOs at non-competitive auction.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said it sold no linear bonds (OLO) at its non-competitive OLO auction on Tuesday after dealers put in no offers.</p>
<p>December OLO auction details - (in billions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Bond line		03/2001  03/2007  Grand total</p>
<p>    Competitive auction  10.040    4.275    14.315</p>
<p>    Non-comp.   auction  00.000   00.000    00.000</p>
<p>    Total		    10.040    4.275    14.315</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
